usage: verify_android.py [-h] [--receipt RECEIPT] [--output OUTPUT] apk

Independently check Judas APK content/native provenance without installing it.
This verifies internal inventories, not publisher authenticity or Android
runtime behaviour. Signature and APK page alignment need apksigner/zipalign
separately.

positional arguments:
  apk

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --receipt RECEIPT
  --output OUTPUT
